# Source: https://forum.mikrotik.com/t/amm0s-forum-plugins-tests-routeros-graphviz-diagrams-colors/261912/1
# Topic: Amm0's Forum Plugins Tests — ` ` `routeros & [graphviz] diagrams & colors
